5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to know who is actually available to run these services before we commit.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to check what happened to the old pilots before we repeat mistakes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The ground conditions and committee agreements are the real bottlenecks, not the drawings.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about the long-term costs hidden in the headline numbers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I think we should look at where the time actually goes for passengers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, do you think the committee minutes will show if we have the staffing?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, maybe the journey audits will tell us if the complaints are real.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, I am looking at the joint operators' minutes and the pre-war shells.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the capital ledger and the ticketing fees to see the true cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I am going to look at the timed runs and the journey audits.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the roster books and the crew establishment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the two pilots from eight years ago and the accessibility records.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I am confirming my choices: joint operators' minutes and contingency pricing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am confirming: balances in the capital ledger and ticketing contractor fees.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I am confirming: timed runs and crowd counts, and journey audits.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
