35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The roster books show the late-turn pool is nearly empty. Overtime is covering everything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The old late-evening pilot actually met its cost-recovery target. That is surprising.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms. That blocks integration.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital ledger has a ring-fenced balance, but the operating subsidy was trimmed again.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Timed runs are slower, but the platform crowds clear at the old rate. The bottleneck is waiting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, if the data terms aren't agreed, how do we do the fare platform?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, so the crowding complaints are about waiting, not the platforms themselves?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the pre-war shells have heavy contingency pricing now. Three jobs stopped for weeks.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Takumi, the accessibility records show two lane-priority stretches were returned to mixed traffic.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, the journey audits say most added minutes are from waiting for connections.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The crew establishment is a third below target. We cannot promise new services without staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The contactless trial on the ferry closed without faults. That part is ready.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The ground might hide voids. I don't trust the delivery dates for station work.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The ticketing fees exceed the resurfacing budget. We are paying too much for the old system.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"If we fix the connections, we fix the time cost. The platforms are fine.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
